{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Red Cubists...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/751a4e5fc0f0a169027b86727d44e31b.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Blue Spherists from the B.S.R.N.A. zone. Which stands for: Blue Spherists Really Needlessly Acronymized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/4ececfbc8afbcff8ab4c48b15d30cedb.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Green Capsulists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/722c92efea41ce6ae34d98574fd13dff.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are all so happy and absolutely delighted to meet you! <u><strong>Our Shmup Boss!</strong></u>\u00a0Look how they smile! Surly they will quickly give you back <u><strong>your turkey sandwich!!!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features TLDR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 in-game fish jokes (one is original)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.poster.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.webm?t=1764949105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.mp4?t=1764949105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Shooter with a unique minimalist cartoony style and a quirky story. Enjoy the thrill and simplicity of a 2D shooter with 3D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 5 levels is distinctively designed. First level is made out of cubes only, while the second of nothing but spheres and the third from capsules to match the story and lore of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story. There is a story menu from which you can read the entire story at your own pace without disturbing gameplay. Each level story and conversation opens up in the main menu after you complete a level. (In-game conversation at the top has been added for\u00a0aesthetics and it can be read in the story menu page.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo multiplier based gameplay. If you want to achieve a high score, keep that multiplier up and eliminate as many waves as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and easy to see Combo timer and multiplier during gameplay! Anyone familiar with the Shmup genre knows that sometimes it's difficult to see stats during gameplay. While this game doesn't reinvent the genre. I tried to at least do what I can. This original interface design has been created in a such way to make it easy to know your combo multiplier timer and combo\u00a0multiplier  values at all times without having to distract you while evading those bullets. Sides space has been fully utilized to improve your shmupping experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay suitable for new and casual shmuppers and which at the same time experienced shmuppers may enjoy. (Hopefully!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Time needed to complete the loop from start to finish without any game overs or retries is about 15-20 minutes.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915580?t=1764949105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/2d18d7aba69096ed49aeb42bf33c8b297dcd497a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764949105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/7d9089a4c7106684f7a92a8194d3ac1db7342ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764949105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/7d9089a4c7106684f7a92a8194d3ac1db7342ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764949105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Red Cubists...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/751a4e5fc0f0a169027b86727d44e31b.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Blue Spherists from the B.S.R.N.A. zone. Which stands for: Blue Spherists Really Needlessly Acronymized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/4ececfbc8afbcff8ab4c48b15d30cedb.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Green Capsulists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/722c92efea41ce6ae34d98574fd13dff.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are all so happy and absolutely delighted to meet you! <u><strong>Our Shmup Boss!</strong></u>\u00a0Look how they smile! Surly they will quickly give you back <u><strong>your turkey sandwich!!!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features TLDR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 in-game fish jokes (one is original)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.poster.avif?t=1764949105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.webm?t=1764949105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/extras/e227b7e9a22c0bf009b153bf311255c2.mp4?t=1764949105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Shooter with a unique minimalist cartoony style and a quirky story. Enjoy the thrill and simplicity of a 2D shooter with 3D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 5 levels is distinctively designed. First level is made out of cubes only, while the second of nothing but spheres and the third from capsules to match the story and lore of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story. There is a story menu from which you can read the entire story at your own pace without disturbing gameplay. Each level story and conversation opens up in the main menu after you complete a level. (In-game conversation at the top has been added for\u00a0aesthetics and it can be read in the story menu page.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo multiplier based gameplay. If you want to achieve a high score, keep that multiplier up and eliminate as many waves as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and easy to see Combo timer and multiplier during gameplay! Anyone familiar with the Shmup genre knows that sometimes it's difficult to see stats during gameplay. While this game doesn't reinvent the genre. I tried to at least do what I can. This original interface design has been created in a such way to make it easy to know your combo multiplier timer and combo\u00a0multiplier  values at all times without having to distract you while evading those bullets. Sides space has been fully utilized to improve your shmupping experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay suitable for new and casual shmuppers and which at the same time experienced shmuppers may enjoy. (Hopefully!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Time needed to complete the loop from start to finish without any game overs or retries is about 15-20 minutes.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Ebal Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/9532cbab13fa72712a09ddf2b702088ae6faca32/header.jpg?t=1764949105","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_